{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "night-eater.power",
  "kind": "character",
  "title": "得点板は夜の味",
  "summary": "無人の客席で「本来の夜」が会場を満たし、兎耳が戦術になる",
  "ownership": {
    "arcId": "character.night-eater",
    "characterId": "night-eater",
    "stage": "power"
  },
  "trigger": {
    "actions": [
      "search",
      "rest"
    ],
    "when": {
      "all": [],
      "any": [],
      "none": []
    },
    "repeat": {
      "mode": "once-per-run"
    },
    "priority": 400,
    "weight": 1
  },
  "presentation": {
    "location": "無人の客席",
    "assets": [
      {
        "id": "night-eater.power.asset.background.001",
        "kind": "background",
        "path": "/assets/story/bg-observation-deck-night.png",
        "alt": "夜の会場の背景"
      },
      {
        "id": "night-eater.power.asset.still.001",
        "kind": "still",
        "path": "/assets/story/events/night-eater-power-v2.png",
        "alt": "暗闇の中、衣擦れまで聞き分ける耳で二人の呼吸が合っていく瞬間"
      }
    ]
  },
  "nodes": [
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "night-eater.power.node.direction.001",
      "command": {
        "type": "background",
        "assetId": "night-eater.power.asset.background.001",
        "transition": "dissolve"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "night-eater.power.node.line.001a",
      "lineId": "night-eater.power.line.001a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "深夜の第三コロシアム。観客は、ゼロ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "night-eater.power.node.line.001b",
      "lineId": "night-eater.power.line.001b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "今夜は特別許可をもらって、本気を確認する日。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "night-eater.power.node.line.001c",
      "lineId": "night-eater.power.line.001c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "付き添いは私と、なぜか今夜もいる計測係の新人くん。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "night-eater.power.node.line.002a",
      "lineId": "night-eater.power.line.002a",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.ij983g",
      "speakerName": "夜を食べるもの",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "本気は、久しぶり。……お行儀悪くても、嫌いにならないで。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "night-eater.power.node.line.003a",
      "lineId": "night-eater.power.line.003a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "前置きが、もう不穏だった。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "night-eater.power.node.line.003b",
      "lineId": "night-eater.power.line.003b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "彼女は客席の中央で、息を吸い——会場の照明を、全部一息に、飲み込んだ。",
      "emotion": "tension"
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "night-eater.power.node.direction.002",
      "command": {
        "type": "effect",
        "effectId": "flash"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "night-eater.power.node.line.004a",
      "lineId": "night-eater.power.line.004a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "闇が来た。ただの停電じゃない。空気の質が変わる、「本来の夜」に。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "night-eater.power.node.line.004b",
      "lineId": "night-eater.power.line.004b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "天井が消えて、満天の星になる。照明は新しい星座になって並んだ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "night-eater.power.node.line.004c",
      "lineId": "night-eater.power.line.004c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "得点板の数字は、蛍の群れで漂う。",
      "emotion": "tension"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "night-eater.power.node.line.005a",
      "lineId": "night-eater.power.line.005a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "新人くんの計測器は、今夜も三秒で「規格外」に。五秒で、煙を吹いた。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "night-eater.power.node.line.005b",
      "lineId": "night-eater.power.line.005b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "暗闇の中、手探りで記録板に何か書いていた。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "night-eater.power.node.line.005c",
      "lineId": "night-eater.power.line.005c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "あとで見たら「くらい。きれい。」——今夜も的確。",
      "emotion": "comic"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "night-eater.power.node.line.006a",
      "lineId": "night-eater.power.line.006a",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.ij983g",
      "speakerName": "夜を食べるもの",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "これが、私の夜。試合でこれをやると……相手は、何も見えなくなる。味方も。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "night-eater.power.node.line.007a",
      "lineId": "night-eater.power.line.007a",
      "speakerId": "mimi",
      "speakerName": "ミミ",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "それで今まで、本気を出さなかったんですね。敵も味方も、まとめて閉店しちゃうから。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "night-eater.power.node.line.008a",
      "lineId": "night-eater.power.line.008a",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.ij983g",
      "speakerName": "夜を食べるもの",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "ええ。私の本気は、ひとりぼっちの技なの。……ずっと、そうだった。"
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "night-eater.power.node.direction.003",
      "command": {
        "type": "still",
        "assetId": "night-eater.power.asset.still.001"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "night-eater.power.node.line.009a",
      "lineId": "night-eater.power.line.009a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "その時、私の耳が、ぴくりと動いた。暗闇の中で、音の景色が、妙にはっきり見える。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "night-eater.power.node.line.009b",
      "lineId": "night-eater.power.line.009b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "新人くんの心拍、彼女の衣擦れ、蛍になった数字の羽音。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "night-eater.power.node.line.009c",
      "lineId": "night-eater.power.line.009c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "——見えた。耳で、会場全体が。",
      "emotion": "revelation"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "night-eater.power.node.line.010a",
      "lineId": "night-eater.power.line.010a",
      "speakerId": "mimi",
      "speakerName": "ミミ",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "……夜を食べるものさん。私、この暗闇の中、耳で全部わかります。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "night-eater.power.node.line.010b",
      "lineId": "night-eater.power.line.010b",
      "speakerId": "mimi",
      "speakerName": "ミミ",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "監督指示、出せます。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "night-eater.power.node.line.011a",
      "lineId": "night-eater.power.line.011a",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.ij983g",
      "speakerName": "夜を食べるもの",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "…………耳。……その耳、飾りじゃなかったの。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "night-eater.power.node.line.012a",
      "lineId": "night-eater.power.line.012a",
      "speakerId": "mimi",
      "speakerName": "ミミ",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "飾りだと思ってたんですか!?"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "night-eater.power.node.line.013a",
      "lineId": "night-eater.power.line.013a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "深夜の無人会場で、変な特訓が始まった。彼女が夜を広げ、私が耳で読んで、声で導く。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "night-eater.power.node.line.013b",
      "lineId": "night-eater.power.line.013b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「三歩右、椅子!」「その先、階段!」"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "night-eater.power.node.line.013c",
      "lineId": "night-eater.power.line.013c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "ひとりぼっちの技が、二人の技に変わっていく。",
      "emotion": "comic"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "night-eater.power.node.line.014a",
      "lineId": "night-eater.power.line.014a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "特訓の締めに、彼女は蛍の数字を、一匹ずつ夜空へ帰した。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "night-eater.power.node.line.014b",
      "lineId": "night-eater.power.line.014b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "最後の一匹「ゼロ」だけを、手のひらに残して見せる。",
      "emotion": "tender"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "night-eater.power.node.line.015a",
      "lineId": "night-eater.power.line.015a",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.ij983g",
      "speakerName": "夜を食べるもの",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "ひとりぼっちの数、ゼロ。……今夜の得点は、これでいい。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "night-eater.power.node.line.016a",
      "lineId": "night-eater.power.line.016a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "うまいこと言った顔（たぶん）の影に、私は笑った。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "night-eater.power.node.line.016b",
      "lineId": "night-eater.power.line.016b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "それから、本題を思い出した。この夜を、試合でどう使うか。",
      "emotion": "resolve"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "id": "night-eater.power.node.choice.001",
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "night-eater.power.choice.001",
          "label": "会場の夜を一口だけ食べてもらう",
          "result": "本番用に「一口ぶんの夜」を調整した。会場の一角だけ本来の夜にして、私の声が届く範囲で戦う型だ。彼女は言った。「私の夜に、初めて他人の声がある。……星、五つ」——食レポの癖は、直らないらしい。",
          "intent": "ひとりぼっちの技を、二人の技にする",
          "promise": "失敗時の危険を引き受け、この人専用の成長を最大まで進める。",
          "memory": "「私の夜に声がある」を、彼女は最高評価の言葉として使う。",
          "tone": "heroic",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "relationship",
              "target": {
                "type": "fighter",
                "fighterId": "night-eater"
              },
              "mode": "add",
              "trust": 10,
              "ownership": -4
            },
            {
              "type": "fighterPoints",
              "target": {
                "type": "fighter",
                "fighterId": "night-eater"
              },
              "amount": 5
            }
          ],
          "goto": "night-eater.power.node.effect.001"
        },
        {
          "id": "night-eater.power.choice.002",
          "label": "相手の影だけを食べる練習を重ねる",
          "result": "相手の影だけを一口いただく精密技を、深夜まで練習した。影を食べられると、自分の居場所が分からなくなるらしい。「行儀のいい食べ方」と彼女は呼んだ。誰も、彼女の敵に回りたくないと思った夜だった。",
          "intent": "会場を巻き込まない精密な型を作る",
          "promise": "本来の力は一部に留め、チーム全体の成長へ成果を持ち帰る。",
          "memory": "「行儀のいい食べ方」の練習に付き合った夜を、チームは覚えている。",
          "tone": "pragmatic",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "relationship",
              "target": {
                "type": "fighter",
                "fighterId": "night-eater"
              },
              "mode": "add",
              "trust": 0,
              "ownership": 9
            },
            {
              "type": "sharedPoints",
              "amount": 5
            }
          ],
          "goto": "night-eater.power.node.effect.001"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "effect",
      "id": "night-eater.power.node.effect.001",
      "effects": [
        {
          "type": "setStoryStage",
          "fighterId": "night-eater",
          "stage": 4
        }
      ]
    },
